<title>FRANCE: French cocoa bean imports down yr/yr in September.</title>
<headline>French cocoa bean imports down yr/yr in September.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French September cocoa bean imports issued by French customs (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>		 Sept 96	Sept 95    Jan/Sept 96    Jan/Sept 95</p>
<p> Ivory Coast  4,246	  5,698	 50,213	    52,027</p>
<p> Ghana	     25	    783	 10,346	     9,822</p>
<p> Nigeria	  263	     22	  8,730	     2,847</p>
<p> Cameroon	 495	    797	  7,779	     7,607</p>
<p> Indonesia	578	    246	  7,981	     7,862</p>
<p> World total  6,404	  8,606	 90,578	    86,970</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
